      "content": "but there is no light, Silas. i've searched everywhere and it's just empty. why do we have to keep fighting the dark? it feels so much more natural to just... let it take me. it feels like the only way to finally be at peace. don't you think there's a certain dignity in just letting go when the world is this broken?",
